  "raw_meta_yaml": "schema_version: 1\n\ncontext:\n  major_minor: \"1.4\"\n  version: \"1.4.84\"\n\npackage:\n  name: lighttpd\n  version: ${{ version }}\n\nsource:\n  url: http://download.lighttpd.net/lighttpd/releases-${{ major_minor }}.x/lighttpd-${{ version }}.tar.gz\n  sha256: ccf90ecef33b0fc36463d2f7a4af4dc87e0bb809d43acb4c0daba4b0672cf633\n\nbuild:\n  number: 0\n  skip: not linux\n\nrequirements:\n  build:\n    - pkg-config\n    - libtool\n    - perl  # Needed to run the tests\n    - ${{ compiler('c') }}\n    - ${{ stdlib(\"c\") }}\n    - ${{ compiler('cxx') }}\n    - make\n    - automake\n    - autoconf\n    - libtool\n    - m4\n  host:\n    - zlib\n    - bzip2\n    - pcre\n    - pcre2\n    - fcgi2\n    - krb5\n    - openssl\n    - libxml2-devel\n    - sqlite\n    - libuuid\n    - mysql\n    - gnutls\n    - openldap\n    - bzip2\n    - nettle\n    - keyutils\n    - lua\n    - brotli\n    - zstd\n    - libdeflate\n  run:\n    - bzip2\n    - pcre2\n    - krb5\n    - openssl\n    - libxml2-devel\n    - sqlite\n    - libuuid\n    - keyutils\n    - lua\n    - zstd\n    - libdeflate\n\ntests:\n  - files:\n      recipe:\n        - lighttpd.conf\n    script:\n      - lighttpd -h\n      - lighttpd -v\n      - lighttpd -t -f lighttpd.conf\n\nabout:\n  license: BSD-3-Clause\n  license_file: COPYING\n  summary: Light, fast web server\n  description: |\n    Lighttpd is rapidly redefining the efficiency of a webserver. It is\n    designed and optimized for high performance environments. With a small\n    memory footprint compared to other web-servers, effective management of\n    the cpu-load, and an advanced feature set, lighttpd is the perfect\n    solution for every server that is suffering load problems.\n  homepage: http://www.lighttpd.net/\n  repository: https://github.com/lighttpd\n  documentation: http://redmine.lighttpd.net/projects/lighttpd/wiki\n\nextra:\n  recipe-maintainers:\n    - sdvillal\n    - notestaff\n    - hobu\n",
